WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:03.150
. Let's go to Cy from Texas.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.150
From Texas.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.150
You're on the air.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:11.140
I just had one question, yes, please speak
up so we can hear you.

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:12.140
Sure.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.140
Is this OK?

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.140
Yeah, that's better.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.140
Yeah.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:21.580
So what are your thoughts on, I guess, the
Democrats promising 2000 other checks and

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:25.530
I guess flip flopping to fourteen hundred
checks instead?

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:26.530
Right.

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:33.809
Personally, I would take anything, but I've
seen a lot of, I guess, criticism from mainly

00:00:33.809 --> 00:00:35.379
the far left.

00:00:35.379 --> 00:00:39.190
So I just I think it's a fair criticism.

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:46.890
So listen, I mean, when when they first started
talking about the one point nine trillion,

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:51.929
you could more plausibly make the argument
that, like, listen, they supported 2000 in

00:00:51.929 --> 00:00:53.280
December.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:01:00.139
And since people got 600, another fourteen
hundred gets us to the total of 2000, like,

00:01:00.139 --> 00:01:02.199
OK, I kind of get that.

00:01:02.199 --> 00:01:06.990
But at this point, by the time people get
any money, it'll probably be March.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:09.159
It'll be almost four months later.

00:01:09.159 --> 00:01:13.920
So I believe that it should be 2000 not not
get us to a total of 2000.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.530
I think it should just be 2000.

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:17.640
So I don't like it like you.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:22.390
I believe that getting 4500 to people is still
so much better than nothing.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:26.880
And hopefully cases will continue coming down,
the economy will start to recover, etc..

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.260
But I don't like it for me.

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:34.770
When they said 2000, the way I understood
it was two thousand more, not fourteen hundred,

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:37.070
to get us to a total of two.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.770
And so I don't, I don't like it one bit.

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:40.390
All right, thank you.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:41.390
Appreciate it.

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:42.390
Thank you.

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:43.390
Great to hear from you.

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:43.890
All right,

